Bimetal Strips in India
A bimetal strip is also called a bimetallic strip; it is created by bonding two different metals, generally copper and aluminum with opposing thermal growth features. This unparalleled mixture enables the strip to bend or deform when exposed to heat making it perfect for operations that need thermal sensitivity and mechanical movement.
Our copper aluminium bimetallic strips are broadly used in thermostats, time delay relays, thermal engines and miniature circuit breakers. When heated the bimetallic strip aluminum and copper elements extend at different rates creating the strip to curve and either make or break an electrical connection. This property makes them important for overcurrent protection and temperature control.
Kalpataru Piping Solutions offers premium-quality bimetallic strips for various electrical and thermal engineering applications. These strips are manufactured to ensure excellent conductivity, durability, and consistent performance across industrial and commercial setups.
Bimetallic Strip Suppliers & Exporters in India
Kalpataru Piping Solutions is one of the most reliable bimetal strip producers in India offering superior quality bimetallic products which match international standards. As a best bimetallic strip producer in India we deliver high-performance products created for a broad spectrum of thermal & electrical applications operations
