Peter Work, Ampelos Vineyards, Lompoc Ca
Congratulations to Chef Andre Rochat Michelin Star Award Winner
As we have said many times before Las Vegas has become one of the wine and gourmet dining hubs of the world. This week the Michelin Restaurant Guide awarded the prestigious one-star rating to Chef Andre Rochat's Alize at the Top of the Palms and to Andres French restaurant downtown. For Chef Andre to win a star for both of his restaurants is a great accomplishment and has received world wide recognition.
Chef Andre Rochat stated, “I am honored beyond words for having been selected as the recipient of such incredibly meaningful honor”,
he went on to add, “I would like to give credit to the members of my staff for their dedication
to their craft and unwavering quest for culinary and service excellence; without them this would not have been possible"". Additionally, I would like to express my gratitude to the Michelin Guide for their recognition and to George Maloof for allowing me the opportunity to open Alize, and bring this wonderful award to The Palms Casino Resort” Chef Rochat concluded.
