how many years was the cosby show on,"['http://www.classic-tv.com/shows/network/nbc', 'https://us.blastingnews.com/showbiz-tv/2016/11/the-cosby-show-re-runs-return-to-bounce-tv-001261861.html', 'https://www.intouchweekly.com/posts/cosby-show-pulled-159007/', 'http://functionmagazine.com/category/celeberities/', 'https://www.thetoptens.com/nickelodeon-nick-nite-shows/', 'https://www.thetoptens.com/tv-shows-have-it-all/', 'https://reelgood.com/show/the-cosby-show-1984']","The Cosby Show is an American television sitcom starring Bill Cosby, which aired for eight seasons on NBC from September 20, 1984 until April 30, 1992. The show focuses on the Huxtable family, an upper middle-class African-American family living in Brooklyn, New York.","Classic TV Shows That Aired On NBC
Since 1995, the Classic TV Database has been dedicated to the best TV shows to air on television.
