where is milan located on the world map,"['http://hunterbaylodge.com/speed-dating-milano.php', 'https://wiki.opengeofiction.net/wiki/index.php/B%C4%83r%C4%83din', 'http://roomauction.com/news/travel-blog/the-italian-cosmopolitan-mecca-milan.html', 'https://www.vrbo.com/2497857ha', 'http://www.gnb2018.polimi.it/venue/tourist-information/', 'http://ieee-powertech.org/venue/about-milano/', 'https://www.vrbo.com/2492658ha']","Milan is located in the north-western section of the Po Valley, approximately halfway between the river Po to the south and the foothills of the Alps with the great lakes (Lake Como, Lake Maggiore, Lake Lugano) to the north, the Ticino river to the west and the Adda to the east. The city's land is flat, the highest point being at 122 m (400.26 ft) above sea level.","403 Forbidden Forbidden You don't have permission to access this resource. Apache/2.4.66 (Debian) Server at wiki.opengeofiction.net Port 443 [SEP_DOC] Mission - SaunaGrow.com Meet in Sauna, Grow your Business3 in 1: Talk with Mentors to expand your business. Relax in a sauna. Support Charity at the same time! Book a meetingCreative meetings & growing biggerHow we work?Following Finnish & ancient tradition we believe that saunas can be used to a great benefit not only as a place for relax. It can also be utilised for business & creative meetings. When at the same time we can support a great charity cause, it’s even better.Our Mentors have different sets of skills. Main focus is on scaling organisations from post-revenue into going global. We can also help in team motivation & creation aspects as well as legal aspects of running & growing a business. It’s quite common as well that as the company grows it needs more support in technical aspects (processes, technical debt and development).Whatever are your growing company needs, our mentors will be able to help themselves or point you out to their big network of people who can help directly.How it works?You choose a mentor and book a sauna 