when did darth vader turn to the dark side,"['https://information2share.wordpress.com/2011/01/03/lord-on-vacation/', 'http://www.worldlibrary.org/articles/Darth_Vader', 'http://costumoid.com/funny-disney-shirts.html', 'https://www.pepakura.eu/star-wars-darth-vader-wall-bust/', 'https://superstarsofcaw.fandom.com/wiki/Darth_Vader', 'http://fashion.zarzarfashion.com/category/uncategorized/', 'https://www.latestdeals.co.uk/tags/darth-vader']","The character was created by George Lucas and has been portrayed by numerous actors. His appearances span the first six Star Wars films, as well as Rogue One, and his character is referenced in both Star Wars: The Force Awakens and Star Wars: The Last Jedi. He is also an important character in the Star Wars expanded universe of television series, video games, novels, literature and comic books. Originally a Jedi prophesied to bring balance to the Force, Anakin is lured to the dark side of the Force by Palpatine, at the time the Supreme Chancellor of the Galactic Republic and secretly the Sith Lord Darth Sidious. He then serves the Galactic Empire as Vader at the right hand of Emperor Palpatine until his redemption after encountering his son, Luke Skywalker. Biologically, he is also the father of Princess Leia Organa, the secret husband of Padmé Amidala before his fall, and grandfather of Kylo Ren.","OUR CONTENT
