what was the original purpose of the black panthers,"['https://upge.wn.com/?activate=0&from=mumiaabujamal.net&ads=1&title=Mumia+abu+jamal&auto=Mumia+abu+jamal&author=system&template=cheetah-photo-search%2Findex.txt&query=Mumia+abu+jamal&pagenum=5', 'https://blackonblackbk.com/collections/tank-tops/products/black-panthers-unisex-tank?variant=34741766977', 'https://tristaneaton.com/uprise-1/', 'https://howlingpixel.com/i-en/Chronology', 'https://z3news.com/w/military-invasion-united-states-coming/', 'http://www.theflowonline.com/HipHopModelReview/579/michael-b-always-causing-problems', 'http://ugfile.com/agents-of-c-h-a-n-g-e/']","At its inception on October 15, 1966, the Black Panther Party's core practice was its armed citizens' patrols to monitor the behavior of officers of the Oakland Police Department and challenge police brutality in Oakland, California. In 1969, community social programs became a core activity of party members. The Black Panther Party instituted a variety of community social programs, most extensively the Free Breakfast for Children Programs, and community health clinics to address issues like food injustice. The party enrolled the largest number of members and made the greatest impact in the Oakland-San Francisco Bay Area, New York, Chicago, Los Angeles, Seattle, and Philadelphia.","Tweet this page
