Toronto → Thousand Islands → Canada Thousand Islands Cruise & Thousand Islands Lunch (Optional, 75 mins) → Ottawa → National War Memorial (Canada), Ottawa Parliament (Outside visit, 30 mins) →Double Decker Montreal (Optional, 60 mins) → Montreal → Old Montreal (30 mins) → Night View of Montreal Notre-Dame Basilica (Outside Visit, 15 mins)
