- a subset of applications for which access is provided by the connect module 2144 can be used to pass IT policy commands from the host system to the hand-held device 2100 . This can be done in a wireless or wired manner.
- These instructions can then be passed to the IT policy module 2146 to modify the configuration of the hand-held device 2100 .
