- fstb(Tsurface temp+fntc(Tntc))=38° C.+1.4° C.=39.4° C.
- assumption: F4body=0° C.
- Tbody=|fstb(Tsurface temp+fntc(Tntc))+F4body|=|39.4° C.+0 C|=39.4° C.
And second, a carotid temperature is calculated using formula 1 as follows:
