1988—Subsecs. (a) to (c). Pub. L. 100–456 struck out “the Canal Zone,” after “Virgin Islands,”.
1958—Subsecs. (a), (b). Pub. L. 85–861, § 2(2)(A), substituted “defense forces authorized by subsection (c)” for “State defense forces”.
