Appearance
Righteousness (also called rectitude) is the quality or state of being morally correct and justifiable.
Quotes
[edit]- Whenever righteousness wanes and unrighteousness increases I send myself forth.
For the protection of the good and for the destruction of evil,
and for the establishment of righteousness,
I come into being age after age.- Bhagavad Gita 4.7–8
