Felix Magath (1953- ) is a German football (soccer) manager and former player, who played as a midfielder. He was active as a player from 1972 to 1986. For parts of the 1970s and Æ80s, he was considered GermanyÆs finest playmaker. He is an avid chess player, a chess patron, and played Garry Kasparov in 1985. (source: Goldsworthy, ōYes2Chessģwith Felix Magrath,ö ChessBase News, Mar 10, 2014 - https://en.chessbase.com/post/yes2chess-with-felix-magath)
