Cedric ōCornbreadö Maxwell (1955- ) is a retired professional basketball player. He played for the Boston Celtics from 1977 to 1985. He played for the Los Angeles Clippers from 1985 to 1987. He played for the Houston Rockets from 1987 to 1988. He was an NBA champion in 1981 and 1984 with the Celtics. He is a chess player.
John McEnroe (1959- ) won 4 US Open titles and 3 Wimbledon titles in tennis. He was ranked No. 1 in the world from 1981 to 1984. He is often considered among the greatest in the history of the sport with 77 singles titles. He also plays chess. When he wasnÆt playing tennis, he played chess with other tennis players. He described himself as a good, but no great, chess player among the other tennis players. He would play two-hour chess matches between tennis. He and tennis player Peter Fleming played a lot of chess together.
