Miroslav Satan (1974- ) is a Slovak former NHL ice hockey right winger. He was active from 1992 to 2014. He is a chess player. (source: ōHockey and Football at the chess board,ö ChessBase, https://en.chessbase.com/post/hockey-and-football-at-the-chess-board)
