Is there any reliable sources indicating the dates of recording of individual parts of the promo video for the song Something? I found one specific date when John and Yoko filmed their part, i.e. November 5, 1969 (source: http://www.beatlesonfilm.com/jl19691105a.html). The dates of recording of the remaining fragments of this promo video by Paul, George and Ringo are stated on that website (http://www.beatlesonfilm.com) as ""early November 1969"" (so not ""late October"" , as indicated in the text above). I don't know how certain the date of November 5, 1969 is, and whether ""late October"" or ""early November"" is really appropriate for the remaining fragments.
It is worth emphasizing that John recorded his fragment about a month and a half after his decision to leave The Beatles, but it is hard to resist the impression that he was still not sure what to do, because he undoubtedly appeared here as a member of the group.
