r and a grocery shop owner) Mother –Â Margaret Ellen (nÃ©e Williams) Siblings –Â He has 2 older sisters. Others –Â Isaac Price (Paternal Grandfather),Â Hanabella (Paternal Grandmother) Manager Jonathan Pryce is represented by William Morris Endeavor Entertainment. Genre Pop Instruments Vocals Labels Unsigned Build Slim Height 6 ft or 183 cm Weight 82 kg or 181 lbs Jonathan Pryce and Rossy de Palma as seen in May 2018 (Jonathan Pryce / Instagram) Girlfriend / Spouse Jonathan Pryce has dated – Kate Fahy (1972-Present) – Jonathan Pryce and actress Kate Fahy met in 1972 atÂ Everyman Theatre and began dating after a few days. The couple later got engaged and have 3 children, Patrick (b. 1983), Gabriel (b. 1986), and Phoebe (b. 1990). Pryce and Fahy tied the knot in 2015 after a long-term relationship of almost 43 years. Race / Ethnicity White Jonathan has Welsh ancestry. Hair Color Salt and pepper Eye Color Hazel Sexual Orientation Straight Distinctive Features Sculpted Nose Tall height Jonathan Pryce at the Sundance Film Festival in January 2014 (PunkToad / Flickr / CC BY-2.0) Brand Endorsements Jonathan Pryce appeared in a TV commercial for Nissan‘s luxury car division in America, Infiniti automobiles, in 1994. Best Known For Playing in the title roleÂ ofÂ HamletÂ at theÂ Royal Court Theatre Enacting Mr. Dark in the 1983 film Something Wicked This Way Comes As a Singer He provided his vocals in numerous songs likeÂ She Is A Diamond andÂ On The Balcony Of The Casa Rosada in the soundtrack of the musical film,Â Evita in 1996. First Film Jonathan Pryce made his theatrical film debut in the 1976Â drama filmÂ Voyage of the DamnedÂ asÂ Joseph Manasse. First TV Show Pryce made his first TV show appearance in 1972 on the sci-fi series,Â DoomwatchÂ as a police constable. Jonathan Pryce’s Favorite Things Writer – Philip Roth Monument –Â St Peter’s in Rome Source – The Telegraph, IMDb Jonathan Pryce during an interview in October 2019 (HeyUGuys / YouTube) Jonathan Pryce Facts He 