ralia.. Brisbane hit hard” “Brisbane.. 18 Terrorism is back! One after another: I had a visual of Moscow. Spirit is pointing to Russia as one of the locations. I had a visual of a Spider crawling on someone’s face, then another crawling. “Terrorism is making its resurgence. In 15 to 20 minutes. That’s points to the 31st – 2nd. I had a visual of one massive fire or explosion: Iraq-Iran I had a visual of a hurricane or Typhoon forming. “The prison is lying.. their treatment of those in prison is egregious.. yet covered up.” Share this and help us alter tomorrows tragedyShare on Tumblr Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window) Email Share on Reddit (Opens in new window) Reddit Tweet Print (Opens in new window) Print Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window) WhatsApp Like this:Like Loading… 64 responses to “Predictions 5-16-18” Katie 16 May 2018 My son is working in Malaysia at the moment. I’m going to warn him , but should I be worried ? Well I am anyway , but do you think malaysia will be hit ? Thanks. Loading… Reply Tim 16 May 2018 Cascadia fault rupture could fulfill the West Coast vision and it could produce a tsunami. Have no idea of whether the water would flow east or west. If it flows west, that would be in the direction of Asia. If east, you have destruction of some unknown magnitude. Cascadia is due west of Heywood and San Andreas fault lines and is north to south from Vancouver down into CA. Loading… Reply mhb 16 May 2018 When it broke 400+ years ago, it produced a tsunami in Japan. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1700_Cascadia_earthquake Loading… Reply 3dakota 16 May 2018 Wow Tim, that would kind of match what someone was saying about a prediction in that the spirits said “deep under water it has occurred and will rise”. Sorry not a direct quote, but similar. It was a comment below the most recent earthquake prediction. Loading… Reply Betty 16 May 2018 Eric,there has been some sites talking about a part of the island of Hawaii can break off along the volca