is egypt part of the middle east or africa,"['http://www.mausimholidays.com/index.php/Controller/LoadPages/MidleEast', 'https://wikivisually.com/wiki/Sunshine_duration', 'http://demo.world-companies.com/loc/middle-east/', 'https://wikimili.com/en/Mandatory_Palestine', 'https://www.toours.com/region/middle-east/1950?lat=29.2985286713&lng=42.5509605408', 'http://flags.vlajky.org/middle_east/', 'http://www.artandpopularculture.com/Middle_East']","The Middle East is a transcontinental region centered on Western Asia, Turkey (both Asian and European), and Egypt (which is mostly in North Africa). Saudi Arabia is geographically the largest Middle Eastern nation while Bahrain is the smallest. The corresponding adjective is Middle Eastern and the derived noun is Middle Easterner. The term has come into wider usage as a replacement of the term Near East (as opposed to the Far East) beginning in the early 20th century.","Sunshine duration - WikiVisually WikiVisually Infinite photos and videos for every Wiki article · Find something interesting to watch in seconds WikiVisually Infinite photos and videos for every Wiki article · Find something interesting to watch in seconds Celebrities Kings of France Rare Coins World Banknotes Wonders of Nature Sports Presidents Recovered Treasures Famous Castles Great Artists Richest US Counties Animals Wars and Battles Largest Palaces Best Campuses Largest Empires Great Cities Orders and Medals Ancient Marvels Countries of the World History by Country Supercars Tallest Buildings Crown Jewels British Monarchs Great Museums more top lists History Sunshine duration Videos Photos Sunshine duration or sunshine hours is a climatological indicator, measuring duration of sunshine in given period for a given location on Earth, typically expressed as an averaged value over several years. It is a general indicator of cloudiness of a location, and thus differs from insolation, which measures the total energy delivered by sunlight over a given period. Campbell–Stokes recorder measures sunshine Cloud cover Videos Photos Cloud cover refers to the fraction of the sky obscured by clouds on average when observed from a particular location. Okta is the usual unit for measurement of the cloud cover. The cloud cover is correlated to the sunshine duration as the least cloudy locales are the sunniest ones while the cloudiest areas are the least sunny places, as clouds can block sunlight, especially at sunrise and sunset where sunlight is already limited. Partial cloud cover over the North Atlantic Ocean. Complete cloud coverage over France"
where did zip a dee doo dah come from,"['https://sheetmusic-free.com/zip-dee-doo-dah-sheet-music-disney/', 'https://bonkersaway.blog/2017/04/27/daily-prompt-zip/', 'http://fikrinet.tk/disneymania-4-go-the-distance-sheet.html', 'http://midkar.com/misc/misc_03.html', 'http://lauriekazmierczak.com/zip-a-dee-doo-dah/', 'https://www.fashiontv.com/post/ftv_blog/film-songs-part-3-james-bond-007/', 'https://www.joytunes.com/blog/music-fun/greatest-oscar-winning-songs-decades/']","""Zip-a-Dee-Doo-Dah"" is a song composed by Allie Wrubel with lyrics by Ray Gilbert from the Disney 1946 live action and animated movie Song of the South, sung by James Baskett. For ""Zip-a-Dee-Doo-Dah"", the film won the Academy Award for Best Original Song and was the second in a long line of Disney songs to win this award, after ""When You Wish upon a Star"" from Pinocchio (1940). In 2004 it finished at number 47 in AFI's 100 Years ... 100 Songs survey of top tunes in American cinema.",where did zip a dee doo dah come from
what is the use of matplotlib in python,"['http://michaeltrevino.info/?page_id=46008', 'http://cbysparkle.com/prince-edward-island/how-to-create-graph-in-python.php', 'https://socialdribbler.com/what-are-the-best-python-mathematics-libraries/', 'https://dataaspirant.wordpress.com/2014/11/01/python-packages-for-datamining/', 'https://www.freelancer.co.it/community/articles/python-libraries-for-data-science', 'https://www.dezyre.com/article/top-5-libraries-for-data-science-in-python/196', 'https://stackskills.com/p/data-visualization-with-python-and-matplotlib']","matplotlib is a plotting library for the Python programming language and its numerical mathematics extension NumPy. It provides an object-oriented API for embedding plots into applications using general-purpose GUI toolkits like Tkinter, wxPython, Qt, or GTK+. There is also a procedural ""pylab"" interface based on a state machine (like OpenGL), designed to closely resemble that of MATLAB, though its use is discouraged. SciPy makes use of matplotlib.","AI Without Tracking or Logs – Private, Uncensored Chat That Doesn’t Watch You Privacy-first AI · No logs · No tracking Stop Being Watched by AI. No logs. No tracking. No memory. No filters. Ask anything — we forget everything. Try asking Shuffle ↑ ■ Powered by NoTrack_uncle — uncensored · Need history & multi-agent debate? Open the full chat → The truth about AI today Every other AI is taking notes. We’re not. Big AI logs every prompt. Trains on your conversations. Builds a profile. Refuses uncomfortable questions. Sells access to your patterns. notrack.ai keeps nothing. Knows nothing about you. Holds no opinion about what you’re allowed to ask. What you get Built for people whothink for themselves. Privacy Your data is not stored. No logs. Ever. Sessions vanish the moment you close the tab. No Tracking We don’t watch, track, or profile you. No analytics. No fingerprints. No cookies that follow you. No Censorship Ask anything. Get real answers. No fake refusal