who sang just call me angel in the morning,"['https://tisdemate.tk/finance/angel-morning-pretenders.php', 'http://artandpopularculture.com/Angel_of_the_Morning', 'http://www.bytownukulele.ca/AllPosts/tabid/906/articleType/ArticleView/articleId/742/Angel-of-the-Morning.aspx', 'https://musiconvinyl.blogspot.com/search/label/Guys%20%27n%27%20Dolls', 'http://phillipjspencer.com/2015/01/']","""Angel of the Morning"" is a popular song, written and composed by Chip Taylor, that has been recorded numerous times by, or has been a hit single for, various artists including Evie Sands, Merrilee Rush, Juice Newton, Nina Simone, P.P. Arnold, Olivia Newton-John, The Pretenders / Chrissie Hynde, Dusty Springfield, Mary Mason, Melba Montgomery, Vagiant, Billie Davis, Bonnie Tyler, Rita Wilson, The New Seekers and Skeeter Davis.",who sang just call me angel in the morning
how old does a song have to be to become public domain,"['http://archimextris.tk/riaa-music-wiki-sheet.html', 'https://marketingstrategies.com/blog/', 'https://support.symdistro.com/hc/en-us/articles/115002711263-About-Public-Domain', 'https://www.bakerdonelsonipwatch.com/2015/02/12/to-understanding-the-copyright-protections-of-pre-1972-sound-recordings-you-have-to-keep-on-trunkin-with-hot-tuna-and-the-sounds-of-the-60s/', 'https://www.orderyourvideo.com/using-copyrighted-music-in-videos-when-is-it-legal/', 'http://personal-domains.info/tag/public-domain/', 'https://irishsheetmusicarchives.com/FAQ.htm']","In the United States, any musical works published before 1922, in addition to those voluntarily placed in public domain, exist in the public domain. In most other countries, music generally enters the public domain in a period of fifty to seventy-five years after the composer's death. (Public domain rights must be verified for each individual country.) It is important to note the distinction between ""musical works"" (sheet music and other compositions) and ""sound recordings"" (audio files, CDs, records), as virtually all sound recordings will not fall into public domain until 2067, unless explicitly placed into the public domain by its creators, rights holders or made by an employee or officer of the United States government acting under their official duty. (The status of copyright on sound recordings in the United States from before such copyrights were nationalized 1972 is nebulous; the copyrights were prior to that were considered a state issue, and even if no state law provided for it, some courts established an extra-legal common law copyright, the exact nature of which has been inconsistently applied over the years.)",how old does a song have to be to become public domain
name of the bearded lady in the greatest showman,"['https://www.playbillder.com/show/vip/Playbill/2019/RENT_Live_54398/page/10', 'https://boxofficebuz.com/person/38717-jane-krakowski', 'https://famousmormons.net/mormon-entertainment/mormon-stage-performers/keala-settle-the-bearded-lady/', 'https://www.salenalettera.com/2018/02/this-is-who-im-meant-to-be.html', 'http://pbaforum.net/viewtopic.php?f=38&p=303719', 'https://www.singers.com/musicals/greatest-showman/', 'http://www.ticketfly.com/event/1733919/']","Keala Joan Settle (born November 5, 1975) is an American actress and singer. Settle originated the role of Norma Valverde in Hands on a Hardbody, which ran on Broadway in 2013, and was nominated for the Outer Critics Circle Award, Drama Desk Award, and Tony Award for Best Featured Actress in a Musical. In 2017, she portrayed Lettie Lutz, a bearded lady, in the musical film The Greatest Showman. The song ""This Is Me"" from the film, principally sung by Settle, won the 2018 Golden Globe Award for Best Original Song, and was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Original Song.","RENT: Live at Playbill - Performances January 27, 2019 - Photos, page: 10 playbill vip HOME HOW IT WORKS FAQs LOG IN Get Started Free Admission Search Playbills ..year..202620252024202320222021202020192018201720162015201420132012 Build Your Audience! CREATE YOUR OWN PLAYBILL® RENT: Live - January 27 Playbill Cover Billing Cast Crew Songs Who's Who Photos Back Page Photos Mario as Benjamin Coffin III and Jordan Fisher as Mark Cohen (Pamela Littky/FOX) Brennin Hunt as Roger Davis and Tinashe as Mimi Marquez (Pamela Littky/FOX) Brandon Victor Dixon as Tom Collins and Valentina as Angel Dumont Schunard (Pamela Littky/FOX) Vanessa Hudgens as Maureen Johnson and Kiersey Clemons as Joanne Jefferson (Pamela Littky/FOX) Page 10 of 20 Share this Production Share URL playbill vip Home How It Works FAQs Policies Get Started Also visit: Playbill.com PlaybillStore.com Copyright © 2026 Playbill, Inc. A