little girl who played in remember the titans,"['https://www.apparelsearch.com/celebrity/female/h/hayden_panettiere/hayden_panettiere_fashion_celebrity_news_photos_video.htm', 'http://viptrace.com/v/hayden%20panettiere', 'https://film.nu/personer/hayden-panettiere/1042375.film', 'https://www.movieranker.com/talent/2HNPRXaEutBEsFS/Hayden-Panettiere', 'https://fanmail.com/movie_tv/actor/hayden_panettiere', 'http://mitchj.info/new/hayden-panettiere-2017.html', 'http://www.debutstars.com/people/hayden-panettiere']","A native of New York, she first appeared in a commercial at the age of 11 months, but a full-time acting career began by playing Sarah Roberts on One Life to Live (1994 -- 1997), and Lizzie Spaulding on Guiding Light (1996 -- 2000), then starring at age 10 as Sheryl Yoast in the Disney feature film Remember the Titans. Other roles include her portrayal of the title character in the true crime drama Amanda Knox: Murder on Trial in Italy and Kirby Reed in the slasher film Scream 4. She received two nominations for the Golden Globe Award for Best Supporting Actress -- Series, Miniseries or Television Film, for her work on Nashville in 2012 and 2013.","Hayden Panettiere Fashion Celebrity : Directory of Fashion Celebrities with Style and Glam Hayden Panettiere Fashion Celebrity Directory - Guide to Celebrity Fashion, Celebrity Style, and Celebrity Glam. The Glamorous side of fashion. Celebrity Fashion Directory Female Fashion Celebrities Male Fashion Celebrities Celebrity News Celebrity Definition Fashion Fashion Blogs Hayden Leslie Panettiere (born August 21, 1989) is an American actress, singer, voice actress, and model. She began her acting career by playing Sarah Roberts on One Life to Live (1994â1997), and Lizzie Spaulding on Guiding Light (1996â2000), before starring at age 10 as Sheryl Yoast in the Disney feature film Remember the Titans. Her most notable role to date is that of cheerleader Claire Bennet on the NBC series Heroes (2006â2010), for which she won several awards. Other recent roles include her portrayal of the title character in true crime drama Amanda Knox: Murder on Trial in Italy and Kirby Reed in the slasher film Scream 4. In October 2012, she began starring as Juliette Barnes in the ABC musical drama series Nashville, for which she was nominated for a Golden Globe Award for Best Supporting Actress â Series, Miniseries or Television Film in 2012. Apparel Search has selected Hayden Panettiere as a fashion celebrity. Bing Search Results: Hayden Panettiere Search Hayden Panettiere News Hayden Panettiere Photos Hayden Panettiere Videos Google Search Results: Hayden Panettiere Hayden Panettiere News Hayden Panettiere Blog Posts Hayden Panettiere Images Hayden Panettiere Video Apparel Search guide to Hayden Panettiere photos, Hayden Panettiere videos, Hayden Panettiere news, Hayden Panettiere blog posts and more. If you are interested in fashion and style, you will be interested in Hayden Panettiere. Search for additional fashion celebrities and fashion icons ... A fashion celebrity, in the opinion of Apparel Search, is a person that has celebrity status and is often watched and judged for what they wear. Here are a few more fashion celebs that you can review. HALLE BERRY HEATHER LOCKLEAR HEIDI KLUM HEIDI MONTAG HILARY DUFF HILARY SWANK Female Fashion Celebrities A-G Female Fashion Celebrities H-P Female Fashion Celebrities Q-Z What is your opinion of Hayden Panettierre? Important quote about her character on the TV series Heros, ""Save the cheerleader save the world"". Share your comments or questions in the discussion area below. Please enable JavaScript to view the comments powered by Disqus. comments powered by Disqus Fashion Industry Fashion Models Apparel Search Add Your Company Contact Us About Us Advertise News Letter Legal Help Copyright © 1999-2023 Apparel Search Company. All Rights Reserved. [SEP_DOC] VipTrace.com is for sale | HugeDomains Skip to main content VipTrace.com Buy now:$6,095 