where does the amalfi coast begin and end,"['https://www.affordableluxurytravel.co.uk/destination/italy-amalfi-coast', 'https://motogpsroutes.com/blog/tarmac-scenic-road-passes/itemlist/tag/coast', 'http://www.ashleycorr.com/amalfi-coast-2/4588520952', 'http://www.italiatours.com/amalfi-vacation.html', 'https://www.dailyjigsawpuzzles.net/landscape-jigsaws/autumn-by-the-pond_1064.html', 'https://www.eaom.org/eami-cfp/', 'http://rvlinks.com/motorhome_hire_croatia.shtml']","Like the rest of the region, the Amalfi Coast lies in a Mediterranean climate, featuring warm summers and mild winters. It is located on the relatively steep southern shore of the Sorrentine Peninsula, leaving little room for rural and agricultural territories. The coast comprises 11,231 hectares between the Gulf of Naples and the Gulf of Salerno. The only land route to the Amalfi Coast is the 40 kilometres (25 mi) long Strada Statale 163 which runs along the coastline from the town of Vietri sul Mare in the east to Positano in the west. Thirteen municipalities are located on the Amalfi Coast, many of them centered on tourism.","Luxtripper Holidays 2026/2027 - Award-Winning Tour Operator No Results Found The Standard, Maldives 7 nights 3,699 2,949 Take Me There Siyam World Maldives 7 nights 3,109 2,249 Take Me There Luxury Kenya Safari with The Mora Zanzibar 10 nights 3,399 3,099 Take Me There Vietnam Holidays Starting from 1,249 Take Me There Thailand Holidays Starting from 999 Take Me There India Holidays Starting from 1,049 Take Me There USA Holidays Starting from 799 Take Me There China Holidays Starting from 1,899 Take Me There Japan Holidays Starting from 1,999 Take Me There Sri Lanka Holidays Starting from 1,699 Take Me There Trustpilot ATOL and ABTA Protected 39 years of Experience Low deposits from £99pp* Price-match promise* ESTD. 1987 Discover the Art of Tailor-Made Luxury Travel At Luxtripper, we believe great holidays begin with thoughtful planning and a personal touch. Our expert team 