where do the colours of the rainbow come from,"['https://rickamitin.com/2018/02/05/staying-inspired-is-a-tricky-business/?shared=email&msg=fail', 'https://wikivisually.com/wiki/Color_garden', 'https://m.jagranjosh.com/articles/amp/ssc-cgl-solved-question-paper-tier-i-exam-held-on-16-august-2015-general-awareness-1533040780-1?ref=amp_list_detail', 'https://mybrokenbrain.org/2014/01/17/one-step-forward-two-steps-back/', 'https://codepoints.net/U+1F308', 'https://www.funfacts.net/questions/what-causes-a-rainbow-to-appear/', 'https://nowathome.wordpress.com/2015/01/']","A rainbow is a meteorological phenomenon that is caused by reflection, refraction and dispersion of light in water droplets resulting in a spectrum of light appearing in the sky. It takes the form of a multicoloured circular arc. Rainbows caused by sunlight always appear in the section of sky directly opposite the sun.","404 - Page not found - Rick Amitin Return Home There was a problem reporting this post. Harassment Harassment or bullying behavior Inappropriate Contains mature or sensitive content Misinformation Contains misleading or false information Offensive Contains abusive or derogatory content Suspicious Contains spam, fake content or potential malware Other Report note Please confirm you want to block this member. You will no longer be able to: See blocked member's posts Mention this member in posts Invite this member to groups Message this member Add this member as a connection Please note: This action will also remove this member from your connections and send a report to the site admin. Please allow a few minutes for this process to complete. You have already reported this . [SEP_DOC] WikiVisually WikiVisually Infinite photos and videos for every Wiki article · Find something interesting to watch in seconds WikiVisually Infinite photos and videos for every Wiki article · Find something interesting to watch in seconds World Banknotes Great Cities Celebrities Presidents Recovered Treasures Cro