in which form chloride is present in water,"['https://wikimili.com/en/Chlorite', 'https://faculty.mu.edu.sa/smohamed/Chloride', 'https://www.clutchprep.com/chemistry/molarity', 'http://bodydetoxtherapy.blogspot.com/', 'https://ejje.weblio.jp/content/chloride', 'http://dynalon.com.my/technical-water-characteristics.php', 'https://imedi.co.uk/sodium-chloride-0-9-intravenous-infusion']","The chloride ion / ˈklɔːraɪd / is the anion (negatively charged ion) Cl. It is formed when the element chlorine (a halogen) gains an electron or when a compound such as hydrogen chloride is dissolved in water or other polar solvents. Chloride salts such as sodium chloride are often very soluble in water. It is an essential electrolyte located in all body fluids responsible for maintaining acid / base balance, transmitting nerve impulses and regulating fluid in and out of cells. Less frequently, the word chloride may also form part of the ""common"" name of chemical compounds in which one or more chlorine atoms are covalently bonded. For example, methyl chloride, with the standard name chloromethane (see IUPAC books) is an organic compound with a covalent C − Cl bond in which the chlorine is not an anion.",in which form chloride is present in water
where is the constellation libra located in the sky,"['https://www.livingcoramdeo.com/2018/10/26/the-musca-constellation/', 'http://www.livingcoramdeo.com/2018/10/05/the-mensa-constellation/', 'http://www.livingcoramdeo.com/2018/09/22/the-lynx-constellation/', 'https://www.livingcoramdeo.com/2019/01/18/the-piscis-austrinus-constellation/', 'http://www.livingcoramdeo.com/2017/10/06/the-apus-constellation/', 'https://www.livingcoramdeo.com/2018/09/14/the-lupus-constellation/', 'https://www.livingcoramdeo.com/2018/07/06/the-hercules-constellation/']","Libra is bordered by the head of Serpens to the north, Virgo to the northwest, Hydra to the southwest, the corner of Centaurus to the southwest, Lupus to the south, Scorpius to the east and Ophiuchus to the northeast. Covering 538.1 square degrees and 1.304% of the night sky, it ranks 29th of the 88 constellations in size. The three-letter abbreviation for the constellation, as adopted by the International Astronomical Union in 1922, is' Lib'. The official constellation boundaries, as set by Eugène Delporte in 1930, are defined by a polygon of 12 segments (illustrated in infobox). In the equatorial coordinate system, the right ascension coordinates of these borders lie between 14 22 08.08 and 16 02 17.23, while the declination coordinates are between − 0.47 ° and − 30.00 °. The whole constellation is visible to observers south of latitude 60 ° N.",where is the constellation libra located in the sky
the supreme court's ruling in the civil rights cases held that,"['http://dgjeep.blogspot.com/2013_04_07_archive.html', 'http://www.civilrightsmovement.co.uk/america-civil-rights-movement.html', 'https://orangecountytribune.com/2018/11/23/green-book-crosses-the-color-line/', 'http://academic.udayton.edu/race/02rights/repara04.htm', 'https://citizenbee.org/supreme-court-cases-civil-war-reconstruction/', 'https://www.opendemocracy.net/en/democracy-in-america-part-4-whats-wrong-with-supreme-court/', 'http://www.pbs.org/wgbh/americanexperience/features/reconstruction-civil-rights-during-reconstruction/']","The Civil Rights Cases, 109 U.S. 3 (1883), were a group of five US Supreme Court constitutional law cases. Against the famous dissent of Justice Harlan, a majority held the Civil Rights Act of 1875 was unconstitutional, because Congress lacked authority to regulate private affairs under the Fourteenth Amendment, and that the Thirteenth Amendment ""merely abolishes slavery"". The Civil Rights Act of 1875 had banned race discrimination in access to services offered to the public. The decision was effectively reversed in the jurisprudence of the Supreme Court from 1937, and finally by legislation under the Civil Rights Act of 1964.","""The Earth and everything that's in it"": April 7, 2013 Saturday, April 13, 2013 I am writing you on e-mail because I am apparently unable to break through the FIRE-WALL you have for First-Class Mail(R) Certified Mail™. Re mailed April 13- 2013 Mr. Downs, I am writing you on e-mail because I am apparently unable to break through the FIRE-WALL you have for First-Class Mail® Certified Mail™. I resently sent yuo the ciertified mail, AGAIN CERTIFIED as Label Number: 7012 2210 0001 2300 8351 Shipment Activity------------------------- Location-------------------- Date & Time Delivered------------------- WASHINGTON DC 20543--- 03/22/13 10:45am Available for Pickup----------- WASHINGTON DC 20543----- 03/22/13 10:35am Arrival at Unit-----------------