where are the ozark mountains located on a map,"['http://gangsterz.tk/3-million-live-roulette-spins.html', 'http://licert.tk/edc-orlando-time-slots.html', 'http://ivantedesco.tk/boot-hill-casino-new-years-eve.html', 'https://howlingpixel.com/i-en/Mountain', 'http://artedmachado.tk/casino-oneida.html', 'http://bienhoa.tk/casino-innsbruck-moes.html', 'http://kagayakuzyosi.info/viewtopic.php?t=11954']","The Ozarks, also referred to as the Ozark Mountains and Ozark Plateau, is a physiographic region in the U.S. states of Arkansas, Missouri, Oklahoma, and Kansas. The Ozarks cover a significant portion of northern Arkansas and southern Missouri, extending from Interstate 40 in Arkansas to the suburbs of St. Louis. A portion of the Ozarks extends into northeastern Oklahoma and southeastern Kansas.",where are the ozark mountains located on a map
