the reason for narrow tube in helium neon laser,['http://www.bode4.com/articles/heliumneon-laser/index'],"A helium -- neon laser or HeNe laser, is a type of gas laser whose gain medium consists of a mixture of 85% helium and 15% neon inside of a small bore capillary tube, usually excited by a DC electrical discharge. The best-known and most widely used HeNe laser operates at a wavelength of 632.8 nm, in the red part of the visible spectrum.",the reason for narrow tube in helium neon laser
