when do you have to have a real id,"['https://beaconbulletin.com/', 'https://mvskokemedia.com/enhanced-tribal-card-coming-to-mcn/', 'https://voat.co/v/news/comments/424119/1885597', 'https://2019.alamidwinter.org/travel/getting-seattle', 'https://employmentimmigration.com/u-s-alert-real-id-act-new-security-measures-start-january-22/', 'http://taralee-alcock.squarespace.com/passports', 'http://reidtravelblog.blogspot.com/2016/03/']","On December 20, 2013, the Department of Homeland Security announced that implementation of Phase 1 would begin on January 20, 2014, which followed a yearlong period of ""deferred enforcement"". There are four planned phases, three of which apply to areas that affect relatively few U.S. citizens -- e.g., DHS headquarters, nuclear power plants, and restricted and semi-restricted federal facilities. On January 8, 2016, DHS issued an implementation schedule for Phase 4, stating that starting January 22, 2018 ""passengers with a driver's license issued by a state that is still not compliant with the REAL ID Act (and has not been granted an extension) will need to show an alternative form of acceptable identification for domestic air travel to board their flight"". Starting October 1, 2020 ""every air traveler will need a REAL ID-compliant license, or another acceptable form of identification, for domestic air travel."" As of October 2017, 28 states and territories have been certified as compliant, and 28 have been granted extensions or a grace period.",when do you have to have a real id
who starred in hitchhiker's guide to the galaxy,"['https://milehicon482016.sched.com/event/8cSf/hitchhikers-guide-to-the-galaxy-2005', 'http://www.uruguaybiotech.com/2017/07/', 'https://culturedaf.co.uk/2013/12/03/after-summer-evermore-succeedsbarren-winter-with-his-wrathful-nipping-cold/', 'https://atlaslit.com/the-hitchhikers-guide-to-the-galaxy-and-islington/', 'https://www.spicywatch.com/blog/road-tripping-with-my-two-favourite-allies', 'https://tricksyknitter.com/blogs/knitting-blog/its-thursday-pander-to-me', 'http://movies2.nytimes.com/2005/04/29/movies/29hitc.html?oref=login']","The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy is a 2005 British-American science fiction comedy film directed by Garth Jennings, based upon previous works in the media franchise of the same name, created by Douglas Adams. It stars Martin Freeman, Sam Rockwell, Mos Def, Zooey Deschanel and the voices of Stephen Fry and Alan Rickman.",who starred in hitchhiker's guide to the galaxy
where are red pandas found in the world,"['http://swf.flashcoo.com/animal/2008_Animal_1680_Desktop_02/index.html', 'https://globalspecies.org/ntaxa/949836', 'https://pndablog.com/2017/06/21/introducing-red-pnda-a-pnda-platform-for-development-demonstration-and-education/', 'https://charlespaddockzoo.org/mammals/red-panda/', 'https://bluebalu.com/2011/12/01/red-pandas-in-ocean-park/', 'https://en.gyaanipedia.co.in/wiki/Red_Panda', 'http://wildlife-animals.com/panda/panda-ipad-iphone-cases.php']","The red panda (Ailurus fulgens), also called the lesser panda, the red bear-cat, the red cat-bear, and the firefox is a mammal native to the eastern Himalayas and southwestern China. It has reddish-brown fur, a long, shaggy tail, and a waddling gait due to its shorter front legs; it is roughly the size of a domestic cat, though with a longer body and somewhat heavier. It is arboreal, feeds mainly on bamboo, but also eats eggs, birds, and insects. It is a solitary animal, mainly active from dusk to dawn, and is largely sedentary during the day.",where are red pandas found in the world
