who contested the first ever day night test in 2015,"['https://wn.com/Test_Match_Special', 'https://www.wikinow.co/topic/test-cricket', 'http://conceptmap.cfapps.io/wikipage?lang=en&name=Test_cricket', 'https://www.pendulumcricket.com/2017/07/27/pendulum-cricket-test-match-overview-2/', 'https://wikivisually.com/wiki/Razor_Smith', 'http://southaustralia.traveller.com.au/article/daynight-cricket-in-the-pink-at-the-adelaide-oval/?=Family']","In October 2012, the International Cricket Council recast the playing conditions for Test matches, permitting day / night Test matches. The first day / night game took place between Australia and New Zealand at the Adelaide Oval, Adelaide on 27 November 2015, 36 years to the day from the first ICC sanctioned day night match.",who contested the first ever day night test in 2015
