what is the meaning of adhan in islam,"['http://mumbaidirectory.info/?option=com_content&view=article&id=26140', 'http://noticiasmvs.info/news.php?subaction=showfull&id=1616', 'https://brokenradio.blog/azaan-islamic-call-to-worship/', 'http://samsul.info/viewtopic.php?t=30685', 'https://janicehurleytrailor.com/35afe6bd/free-printable-dua-supplications', 'http://thespotgalveston.com/alberta/how-to-give-best-azan.php', 'http://www.surajmusic.com/tag/%D8%B9%D8%A8%D8%AF-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A8%D8%A7%D8%B3%D8%B7-%D8%B9%D8%A8%D8%AF-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B5%D9%85%D8%AF/']","The adhan, athan, or azaan (Arabic: أَذَان ‎ (ʔaˈðaːn)) (also called in Turkish: Ezan) is the Islamic call to worship, recited by the muezzin at prescribed times of the day. The root of the word is ʾadhina أَذِنَ meaning ""to listen, to hear, be informed about"". Another derivative of this word is ʾudhun (أُذُن), meaning ""ear"".",what is the meaning of adhan in islam
how many stairs are there in the effiel tower,"['http://amipsyche.com/eiffel-tower-paris.html', 'https://interestingfacts.tv/amazing-facts/interesting-facts-about-eiffel-tower-an-iconic-monument-decorating-the-skyline-of-paris/', 'https://www.pelicanstay.com/search/france/paris/', 'https://abdulshop.com/2018/12/10/things-to-do-in-paris/?shared=email&msg=fail', 'https://www.skyscanner.com.ph/flights-from/cdg/cheap-flights-from-paris-charles-de-gaulle-airport.html', 'https://www.slothtravels.com/en/europe/france/ile-de-france/paris/eiffel-tower', 'https://historybytez.com/2016/03/31/1889-the-eiffel-tower-is-officially-opened/']","The tower has three levels for visitors, with restaurants on the first and second levels. The top level's upper platform is 276 m (906 ft) above the ground -- the highest observation deck accessible to the public in the European Union. Tickets can be purchased to ascend by stairs or lift (elevator) to the first and second levels. The climb from ground level to the first level is over 300 steps, as is the climb from the first level to the second. Although there is a staircase to the top level, it is usually accessible only by lift.",how many stairs are there in the effiel tower
