who wrote sam smith writings on the wall,"['http://participal.info/news.php?subaction=showfull&id=13469', 'http://strip349.info/forum.php?mod=viewthread&tid=4034', 'https://www.fashiontv.com/post/ftv_blog/film-songs-part-3-james-bond-007/', 'http://1899t.info/?newsid=7595', 'https://www.somosbastardos.com/2018/04/covers-by-sofia-karlberg.html', 'http://beatzone.eu/track/Miley+Cyrus/Wrecking+Ball', 'https://lapeliculas.com/pelicula/miley-cyrus-wrecking-ball']","""Writing's on the Wall"" is a song by English singer Sam Smith, written for the release of the 2015 James Bond film Spectre. The song was released as a digital download on 25 September 2015. The song was written by Smith and Jimmy Napes, and produced by the latter alongside Steve Fitzmaurice and Disclosure and released on 25 September 2015.",who wrote sam smith writings on the wall
origin of classical development of modern french cuisine,"['https://www.thefrenchcookingacademy.com/cuisine/french-cuisine/', 'https://alotoftrips.com/entity/french-cuisine/', 'https://missmillmag.com/travel/top-10-most-tasty-cuisines-in-the-world/', 'https://www.sanjeevkapoor.com/Allrecipes/Cuisines/French', 'https://infogalactic.com/info/French_cuisine', 'http://the-food-guy.com/index.php/recipes/international/recipes-region/french/', 'http://lenasflowersandcatering.com/menus.html']","In the 14th century Guillaume Tirel, a court chef known as ""Taillevent"", wrote Le Viandier, one of the earliest recipe collections of medieval France. During that time, French cuisine was heavily influenced by Italian cuisine. In the 17th century, chefs François Pierre La Varenne and Marie-Antoine Carême spearheaded movements that shifted French cooking away from its foreign influences and developed France's own indigenous style. Cheese and wine are a major part of the cuisine. They play different roles regionally and nationally, with many variations and appellation d'origine contrôlée (AOC) (regulated appellation) laws.",origin of classical development of modern french cuisine
