how do you separate a liquid from a gas,['http://biofuelsacademy.org/index.html%3Fp=324.html'],"For the common variety, gravity is utilized in a vertical vessel to cause the liquid to settle to the bottom of the vessel, where it is withdrawn.",how do you separate a liquid from a gas
where is the dasht e kavir desert located on a map,"['http://en.shahrmajazi.com/page89245', 'http://arksphoto.com/galleries/dance-of-the-wind.html', ""https://www.saadatrent.com/Iran's-desert"", 'https://www.revealingpersia.com/iran-adventure-tours/', 'https://triptopersia.com/about-iran/iran-deserts', 'https://kalouttour.com/category/iran-desert/', 'http://en.shahrmajazi.com/page89009']","Dasht-e Kavir (Persian: دشت كوير ‎ ‎, lit.' Low Plains' in classical Persian, from khwar (low), and dasht (plain), flatland), also known as Kavir-e Namak (lit.' salty lowlands') and the Great Salt Desert, is a large desert lying in the middle of the Iranian plateau. It is about 800 km (500 mi) by 320 km (200 mi) with a total surface area of about 77,600 km (30,000 sq mi), making it the Earth's 26th largest desert. The area of this desert stretches from the Alborz mountain range in the north-west to the Dasht-e Lut in the south-east and is partitioned between the Iranian provinces of Khorasan, Semnan, Tehran, Isfahan and Yazd",where is the dasht e kavir desert located on a map
why does mr bean fall from the sky,"['https://mr89bean.wordpress.com/2016/09/30/mr-bean-spies-in-the-shower/', 'http://findcrazy.blogspot.com/2011/11/mrbean-daughters-rare-pics.html', 'http://lifeontheline.info/search?q=Fallen%20over%20cartoon', 'https://mrbeantheanimatedseries.fandom.com/wiki/Mr_Bean']","At the beginning of episode two onwards, as part of the opening credits, Mr. Bean falls from the sky in a beam of light, accompanied by a choir singing Ecce homo qui est faba (""Behold the man who is a bean""), recorded by Southwark Cathedral Choir in 1990. These opening sequences were initially in black and white in episodes two and three, and were intended by the producers to show his status as an ""ordinary man cast into the spotlight"". However, later episodes showed Mr. Bean dropping from the night sky in a deserted London street against the backdrop of St Paul's Cathedral. At the end of episodes three and six he is also shown being sucked right back up into the sky in the respective background scenes (black scene in episode 3 and street scene in episode 6). Atkinson has acknowledged that Bean ""has a slightly alien aspect to him"". In an episode of the animated series, ""Double Trouble"", the alien aspect of him was used in a storyline, in which he is taken inside a spacecraft with ""aliens"" who look exactly like him and even have their own plushy toys. In an obvious homage towards the end, the aliens send him back home in a beam of light and music similar to the opening of the original Mr. Bean series. Whether Bean is an extraterrestrial is not made clear.",why does mr bean fall from the sky
abhinav bindra anjali bhagwat have represented india in which sport,"['http://www.marathisanmaan.com/biographies/sportsperson/anjali-bhagwat', 'http://legendshub.com/Anjali-Bhagwat/', 'https://www.uclan.ac.uk/news/squash-honorary-fellowship.php', 'http://london-osteopath.com/', 'https://london-osteopath.com/swedish-massage-in-london/', 'https://www.mavericksnetball.co.uk/News/international-signings-strengthen-squad-for-2016-season/', 'https://www.bfaeastern.org/News/performance-training-day-foil-sabre/']","Anjali won the ISSF Champion of Champions award and is the only Indian to win the ISSF Champions' Trophy in Air Rifle Men & Women mixed event at Munich in 2002. She has represented India in three consecutive Olympics, and was a finalist in the 2000 Sydney Olympics, again a first for any Indian women shooter. She has won 12 gold and 4 silver medals in the Commonwealth Games. She is a Commonwealth record holder in 10m Air Rifle and Sports Rifle 3P. In the 2003 Afro-Asian Games, Bhagwat created history by becoming the first Indian woman shooter to get gold and a silver medal in the Sports 3P and Air Rifle events respectively.",abhinav bindra anjali bhagwat have represented india in which sport
why is orange is the new black season 5 not on netflix,"['http://tamparealestate4you.com/victoria/the-story-of-her-holding-an-orange-pdf-download.php', 'http://lederjackekaufen.tk/custom-equipment-slots-script.html', 'http://csa-clan.tk/taxes-on-casino-winnings-mississippi.html', 'http://helenwade.tk/poker-rollover.html', 'http://birwa.tk/slots-melbourne-florida.html', 'http://jasaautoblog.tk/craps-odds-buy-bets.html', 'http://herooffice.tk/best-in-slot-blut-dk.html']","The fifth season of the American comedy-drama television series Orange Is the New Black premiered on Netflix on June 9, 2017, at 12: 00 am PST in multiple countries. It consists of thirteen episodes, each between 51 -- 60 minutes. The series is based on Piper Kerman's memoir, Orange Is the New Black: My Year in a Women's Prison (2010), about her experiences at FCI Danbury, a minimum-security federal prison. The series is created and adapted for television by Jenji Kohan.",why is orange is the new black season 5 not on netflix
when did the teotihuacan civilization start and end,"['http://www.martindoustar.com/objet_58', 'https://www.unknownworld.co.uk/teotihuacan/', 'https://earthnworld.com/lost-cities/', 'https://wikivisually.com/wiki/Pyramid_of_the_Moon', 'http://yourcountryside.info/53798-geography-of-japan-and-mesoamerica/']","The city is thought to have been established around 100 BC, with major monuments continuously under construction until about 250 AD. The city may have lasted until sometime between the 7th and 8th centuries AD, but its major monuments were sacked and systematically burned around 550 AD.",when did the teotihuacan civilization start and end
