where is the parent company of samsung located,"['https://www.barrypopik.com/index.php/new_york_city/entry/shamsung_samsung_nickname', 'https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmXoypizjW3WknFiJnKLwHCnL72vedxjQkDDP1mXWo6uco/wiki/Samsung.html', 'http://aerosoul.tk/casino-boat-miami.html', 'http://degala.tk/basket-roulette-discount.html', 'http://capcautoblaerop.simplesite.com/433967514', 'https://turbo-pizda.info/new-york-giants-galaxy-s8-plus-bold-dual-hybrid-case.aspx', 'http://clan-centurio.guildwork.com/forum/threads/5ba3530a002aa82e15ab9dde-manageengine-servicedesk-plus-9-crack']","Samsung Group (Hangul: 삼성; Hanja: 三星; Korean pronunciation: (shamshʌŋ)) is a South Korean multinational conglomerate headquartered in Samsung Town, Seoul. It comprises numerous affiliated businesses, most of them united under the Samsung brand, and is the largest South Korean chaebol (business conglomerate).",where is the parent company of samsung located
what are the three different states that water occurs as during the water cycle,"['https://www.sjwater.com/our-company/news-media/water-blogged/ensuring-future-water-supply-reliability', 'https://coloringpagebase.com/collection/water-cycle-coloring-page/', 'http://coolgeography.co.uk/advanced/Water_Cycle.php', 'https://www.friendsofwater.com/the-water-cycle/', 'https://faculty.mu.edu.sa/smohamed/Hydrologic%20cycle', 'https://ourplnt.com/tag/water/', 'http://downlwhopkd.cf/maqo/water-cycle-essay-laq.php']","The water cycle, also known as the hydrological cycle or the hydrologic cycle, describes the continuous movement of water on, above and below the surface of the Earth. The mass of water on Earth remains fairly constant over time but the partitioning of the water into the major reservoirs of ice, fresh water, saline water and atmospheric water is variable depending on a wide range of climatic variables. The water moves from one reservoir to another, such as from river to ocean, or from the ocean to the atmosphere, by the physical processes of evaporation, condensation, precipitation, infiltration, surface runoff, and subsurface flow. In doing so, the water goes through different forms: liquid, solid (ice) and vapor.",what are the three different states that water occurs as during the water cycle
where do you punt from after a safety,"['http://wiki-offline.jakearchibald.com/wiki/Safety_(gridiron_football_score)', 'https://svenskdesign.eu/us-football.html', 'http://wilson.engr.wisc.edu/rsfc/intro/', 'http://gamecafe.cf/79901-2019/football-odds-rules-jof.php', 'http://smrill.com/football/improve-your-game-with-these-tips-from-the-football-experts/', 'http://smrill.com/football/helping-you-better-understand-football-with-these-simple-to-follow-tips-4/', 'https://ownyourbookie.com/tag/field-goal/']","After a safety is scored, the ball is put into play by a free kick. The team that was scored upon must kick the ball from their own 20-yard line and can punt, drop kick, or place kick the ball. In professional play, a kicking tee cannot be used -- however, a tee can be used in high school or college football. Once the ball has been kicked, it can be caught and advanced by any member of the receiving team, and it can be recovered by the kicking team if the ball travels at least 10 yards and bounces at least once or a player of the receiving team touches the ball.",where do you punt from after a safety
how many versions of the apple pencil are there,"['https://www.gadgitechstore.com/collections/smartphone-tablet-accessories/products/apple-pencil-2nd-generation', 'https://www.apple.com/il/apple-pencil/', 'http://blikline.eu/brush-pen/apple-pencil-presenting-the-all%E2%80%91new-apple-pencil.html', 'https://zebrahow.com/2018/10/20/new-apple-products-2018-2019-30th-october-2018/', 'http://justbcause.com/blog/Apple%20event', 'http://bauxy.com/serial-number-apple-pencil-2.html', 'https://www.msntarget.com/search/label/Apple']","On October 30, 2018, at the Apple Special Event, Apple announced the second generation of Apple Pencil. The new Apple Pencil attaches magnetically with a snap onto the side of your iPad Pro. Once attached, it starts to charge and automatically pairs with your device, as opposed to plugging in the iPad to connect via Bluetooth.",how many versions of the apple pencil are there
where is the bridge that turns into a tunnel in va,"['https://kids.kiddle.co/Chesapeake_Bay_Bridge-Tunnel', 'https://tonysaborie.blog/tag/florida-to-pennsylvania/', 'https://www.spectroom.com/category/171127301-bridges', 'https://cooperhurley.com/blog/hampton-roads-is-not-about-the-roads-its-about-the-water/', 'https://www.britannica.com/place/Hampton-Roads', 'https://www.tgci.com/funding-sources/Virginia', 'https://howlingpixel.com/i-en/Chesapeake_Bay']","The Chesapeake Bay Bridge -- Tunnel (CBBT) is a 23-mile (37 km) bridge -- tunnel crossing at the mouth of the Chesapeake Bay, the Hampton Roads harbor, and nearby mouths of the James and Elizabeth Rivers in the American state of Virginia. It connects Northampton County on the Delmarva Peninsula and Eastern Shore with Virginia Beach, Norfolk, Chesapeake, and Portsmouth on the Western Shore and South side / Tidewater which are part of the Hampton Roads metropolitan area of eight close cities around the harbor's shores and peninsula. The Bridge-Tunnel originally combined 12 miles (19 km) of trestle, two 1-mile-long (1.6 km) tunnels, four artificial islands, four high-level bridges, approximately 2 miles (3.2 km) of causeway, and 5.5 miles (8.9 km) of northeast and southwest approach roads -- crossing the Chesapeake Bay and preserving traffic on the Thimble Shoals and Chesapeake dredged shipping channels leading to the Atlantic. It replaced vehicle ferry services that operated from South Hampton Roads and from the Virginia Peninsula since the 1930s. Financed by toll revenue bonds, the Bridge -- Tunnel was opened on April 15, 1964, and remains one of only ten bridge -- tunnel systems in the world, three of which are located in the water dominated Hampton Roads area of Tidewater Virginia.",where is the bridge that turns into a tunnel in va
when was blue cross and blue shield founded,"['http://www.stibroker.com/health-insurance-companies/', 'https://apex.rehab/verify-insurance/blue-shield/', 'https://www.giangolainsurance.com/blog/medical-mutual-of-ohio-vs.-anthem-blue-cross-blue-shield', 'https://www.finalquote.com/articles/blue-cross-blue-shield-health-insurance/', 'https://shopinsuranceplans.com/bluecross-blueshield/', 'https://btweyl.info/blue-shield-of-northeastern-new-york.html', 'https://www.interactiveadvantage.com/clients/bluecross-blueshield']","Blue Cross Blue Shield Association (BCBSA) is a federation of 36 separate United States health insurance organizations and companies, providing health insurance in the United States to more than 106 million people. Blue Cross was founded in 1929 and became the Blue Cross Association in 1960, while Blue Shield emerged in 1939 and the Blue Shield Association was created in 1948. The two organizations merged in 1982.",when was blue cross and blue shield founded
where are highest average incomes found in north america,"['https://www.thenewsstar.com/story/money/economy/2018/01/22/u-s-economy-rundown-poorest-county-every-state/1045715001/', 'https://www.metro.net/about/placcp/definitions-pla/', 'http://www.paceadvantage.com/forum/archive/index.php/t-54166.html', 'https://www.forbes.com/2011/04/11/americas-richest-counties-business-washington.html', 'https://www.cdc.gov/mmwr/preview/mmwrhtml/00001177.htm', 'http://indianapolisstats.com/indiana-drinks-the-8th-most-soda/', 'http://nikitas3.com/12690/border-wall-will-pay-lets-move-federal-jobs-dc/']","Presented below are the 25 wealthiest counties (with populations of 65,000 or greater) in the United States by median household income according to the 2012 American Community Survey prepared by the US Census Bureau. Six of the counties are located in the state of Maryland, five are in Virginia, four in New Jersey, three in New York, two in California, and one each in: Colorado, Georgia, Michigan, Tennessee, and Texas.",where are highest average incomes found in north america
what is the difference between internationalization and localization,"['https://doc-snapshots.qt.io/qt5-dev/internationalization.html', 'http://chesterbullock.com/south-australia/how-to-prepare-for-nls.php', 'https://www.vskills.in/certification/certified-software-testing-professional-learning-resources-internationalization-and-localization', 'http://feedlogger.com/phases-of-the-software-translation-process-defined/', 'https://wikivisually.com/wiki/Unicode', 'https://www.mtmlinguasoft.com/ufaqs/8-what-is-the-difference-between-internationalization-and-localization/', 'http://schoolofweb.org/blog/going-global-web-globalization-strategies-interview-with-john-yunker/']","In computing, internationalization and localization are means of adapting computer software to different languages, regional differences and technical requirements of a target market (locale). Internationalization is the process of designing a software application so that it can potentially be adapted to various languages and regions without engineering changes. Localization is the process of adapting internationalized software for a specific region or language by adding locale-specific components and translating text. Localization (which is potentially performed multiple times, for different locales) uses the infrastructure or flexibility provided by internationalization (which is ideally performed only once, or as an integral part of ongoing development).",what is the difference between internationalization and localization
what is their eyes are watching god about,"['https://www.biblio.com/book/eyes-were-watching-god-zora-neale/d/1212721221', 'https://auburndalelibrary.org/2015/08/23/read-now-discuss-in-september-the-acl-book-club-their-eyes-were-watching-god-on-saturday-september-12th-at-1100-am/', 'https://www.hebor.dk/tips-rejser-irland-kultur-historie/litteratur-irland-kultur.html', 'https://ynccf.net/their-eyes-were-watching-cake-quotes', 'https://sosasharon.com/2017/04/25/brunching-with-bgbc-black-girls-book-club-24th/?shared=email&msg=fail', 'https://www.bordermail.com.au/story/6053787/a-farm-stay-like-no-other-as-animal-farm-reaches-the-butter-factory-theatre/', 'https://stairnaheireann.net/2017/03/13/otd-in-1939-at-swim-two-birds-a-highly-experimental-novel-by-flann-obrien-is-published-in-london/']","Their Eyes Were Watching God is a 1937 novel and the best known work by African-American writer Zora Neale Hurston. The novel narrates main character Janie Crawford's ""ripening from a vibrant, but voiceless, teenage girl into a woman with her finger on the trigger of her own destiny."" As a young woman, who is fair-skinned with long hair, she expects more out of life, but comes to realize that people must learn about life' fuh theyselves' (for themselves), just as people can only go to God for themselves. Set in central and southern Florida in the early 20th century, the novel was initially poorly received, but today, it has come to be regarded as a seminal work in both African-American literature and women's literature. TIME included the novel in its 2005 list of the 100 best English-language novels published since 1923.",what is their eyes are watching god about
how to find the valuation of a stock,"['https://www.assignmentconsultancy.com/stock-valuation-finance-assignment-help/', 'http://www.sharemarket.in/category/stock-market-analyst', 'https://financeassignments.xyz/dividend-discount-model-21129', 'http://baby-1007.info/vvvy/stock-valuation-example-bys.php', 'http://www.eiiff.com/corporate-finance/business-valuation/stock-valuation.html', 'https://www.valuewalk.com/2018/04/blue-tower-asset-management-1q18-commentary/', 'https://www.thediv-net.com/2015/07/5-best-stocks-for-retirement-investors.html']","The most theoretically sound stock valuation method, called income valuation or the discounted cash flow (DCF) method, involves discounting of the profits (dividends, earnings, or cash flows) the stock will bring to the stockholder in the foreseeable future, and a final value on disposal. The discounted rate normally includes a risk premium which is commonly based on the capital asset pricing model.",how to find the valuation of a stock
