what is the name of the volcano in seattle,"['http://tusentakk2.com/wordpress/2018/09/mount-rainier-august-16-2018/', 'http://www.borderlinerunningclub.com/2018/06/01/brc-run-602-away-game-7-4-mi-pay-attention/', 'https://www.shapeways.com/product/3GXCCV6RH/mount-rainier-summit-map-5-quot?optionId=67233344', 'http://www.melissagross.com/2018/08/take-three-thursday-framed-mountain.html', 'http://darkskywest.com/rainier-np-milky-way-and-mount-rainier-360.htm', 'https://studyres.com/concepts/9517/mount-rainier', 'https://landscapeart.garyjohnsonphotography.com/shop-fine-art/art_print_products/mt-rainer?product_gallery=37119&product_id=1629005']","Mount Rainier (pronounced: / reɪˈnɪər /) is the highest mountain of the Cascade Range of the Pacific Northwest, and the highest mountain in the U.S. state of Washington. It is a large active stratovolcano located 59 miles (95 km) south-southeast of Seattle, in the Mount Rainier National Park. It is the most topographically prominent mountain in the contiguous United States and the Cascade Volcanic Arc, with a summit elevation of 14,411 ft (4,392 m).",what is the name of the volcano in seattle
what are the three products of the krebs cycle,"['https://www.aleobme.com/technology.html', 'https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmXoypizjW3WknFiJnKLwHCnL72vedxjQkDDP1mXWo6uco/wiki/Citric_acid_cycle.html', 'http://ptgcn.com/products/featured-products/mitochondria-antibodies/', 'https://ptglab.com/news/blog/mitochondria-center-of-cellular-signaling-and-energetic-balance/', 'https://www.advancedequinesolutions.com/product/enduro-500/', 'https://www.conceptdraw.com/examples/water-cycle-simple-drawing', 'https://upge.wn.com/?activate=0&from=acetictransport.com&ads=1&title=Acetic+transport&auto=Acetic+transport&author=system&template=cheetah-photo-search%2Findex.txt&query=Acetic+transport&pagenum=3']","The citric acid cycle (CAC) -- also known as the tricarboxylic acid (TCA) cycle or the Krebs cycle -- is a series of chemical reactions used by all aerobic organisms to release stored energy through the oxidation of acetyl-CoA derived from carbohydrates, fats, and proteins into carbon dioxide and chemical energy in the form of adenosine triphosphate (ATP). In addition, the cycle provides precursors of certain amino acids, as well as the reducing agent NADH, that are used in numerous other biochemical reactions. Its central importance to many biochemical pathways suggests that it was one of the earliest established components of cellular metabolism and may have originated abiogenically. Even though it is branded as a' cycle', it is not necessary for metabolites to follow only one specific route; at least three segments of the citric acid cycle have been recognized.",what are the three products of the krebs cycle
difference between senate and house of commons canada,"['https://wikivisually.com/wiki/Yukon', 'https://rankly.com/list/best-governmental-body-off-all-time', 'https://sencanada.ca/en/content/sen/chamber/421/debates/210db_2018-05-29-e', 'https://oregonsigmanu.com/introduction-in-this-essay-i-will-be-discussing-the-canadian-senate/', 'https://www.thoughtco.com/role-of-the-prime-minister-510890', 'http://www.canadaka.net/content/page/108-canadian-house-of-commons', 'http://www.ganjico.com/Canada']","While the Senate is the upper house of Parliament and the House of Commons is the lower house, this does not imply the Senate is more powerful than the House of Commons. It merely entails that its members and officers outrank the members and officers of the Commons in the order of precedence for the purposes of protocol. As a matter of practice and custom, the Commons is the dominant chamber. The prime minister and Cabinet are responsible solely to the House of Commons and remain in office only so long as they retain the confidence of the House of Commons.",difference between senate and house of commons canada
where can i see a wrinkle in time movie,"['https://d2100.gq/a282/', 'https://theslanted.com/2019/03/32710/wondercon-stargirl-swamp-thing-season-1-dc-universe/', 'http://www.redvdit.net/the-mule/', 'https://brickshow.com/2019/03/home-media-release-dates-for-lego-movie-2-announced', 'https://movieweb.com/pacific-rim-2-uprising-blu-ray-dvd-release-date-details/', 'https://hd-report.com/2018/02/21/pitch-perfect-3-releasing-to-4k-blu-ray-blu-ray/', 'https://theslanted.com/2018/07/30269/jurassic-world-fallen-kingdom-digital-release-date/']","A Wrinkle in Time is scheduled to be released on 4K UHD Blu-Ray, Blu-Ray & DVD on June 5, 2018.",where can i see a wrinkle in time movie
how many rats are there in new york city,"['http://slidorion.com/2017/12/rat-in-nyc/', 'https://www.bugdoctorpestcontrolservices.com/prepare-your-home-for-fall-pests/', 'https://www.reference.com/web?q=How+Big+Do+Rats+Get%3F&qo=contentPageRelatedSearch&o=600605&l=dir', 'https://www.grass-greener.com/combating-rodents-expert-tips-on-how-to-get-rid-of-rats/', 'https://www.hoerradvancedpest.com/rodent-control-new-tactic-to-control-subway-rats/', 'https://motherboard.vice.com/en_us/article/gv5dn3/surveilling-rats']","Rats in New York City are widespread, as they are in many densely populated areas. For a long time, the number of rats in New York City was unknown, and a common urban legend was that there were up to five times as many rats as people. In 2014, however, scientists more accurately measured the entire city's rat population to be approximately only 20% of the number of humans; that is, there were approximately 2 million rats to New York's 8.4 million people at the time of the study.",how many rats are there in new york city
what happens at the end of arabian nights,"['http://www.thefullwiki.org/Sheherazade', 'https://5writers5novels5months.com/tag/1001-nights/', 'https://www.tehrantimes.com/news/301065/Iranian-troupe-to-perform-musical-Scheherazade-the-Storyteller', 'https://bibliocrunch.com/book-facts/11-of-the-most-iconic-book-couples/']","And so the king kept Scheherazade alive day by day, as he eagerly anticipated the finishing of the previous night's story. At the end of 1,001 nights, and 1,000 stories, Scheherazade told the king that she had no more tales to tell him. During these 1,001 nights, the king had fallen in love with Scheherazade. He spared her life, and made her his queen.",what happens at the end of arabian nights
when did they figure out that yeast made bread rise,"['https://www.joinpuzzle.com/campaigns/the-bread-bar/', 'http://steungmeanchey.com/2016/09/14/cooking-delicious-food-at-home/', 'http://wiki-offline.jakearchibald.com/wiki/Bread', 'http://maps.thefullwiki.org/Bread', 'https://rabbisylviarothschild.com/tag/bread/', 'http://kolyaski.ml/are-bm-beans-gluten-free-11.php', 'https://www.hdnews.net/0145b624-dcf5-53e1-9751-cff7fc3d32cd.html']","The most common source of leavening in antiquity was to retain a piece of dough (with sugar and water in) from the previous day to utilize as a form of sourdough starter. Pliny the Elder reported that the Gauls and Iberians used the foam skimmed from beer to produce ""a lighter kind of bread than other peoples."" Parts of the ancient world that drank wine instead of beer used a paste composed of grape must and flour that was allowed to begin fermenting, or wheat bran steeped in wine, as a source for yeast.",when did they figure out that yeast made bread rise
what fraction of one minute is 23 second(s),"['http://leopand.ru/a-period-is-measured-in-terms-of-which-of-these/', 'http://www.sciencechatforum.com/viewtopic.php?p=320070', 'https://derickrethans.nl/leap-seconds-and-what-to-do-with-them.html', 'http://www.factbites.com/topics/SI-base-unit', 'https://www.gordonengland.co.uk/conversion/sidef.htm', 'http://webs.mn.catholic.edu.au/physics/emery/measurement.htm', 'https://howlingpixel.com/i-en/Ephemeris_time']","The second (symbol: s) (abbreviated s or sec) is the base unit of time in the International System of Units (SI). It is qualitatively defined as the second division of the hour by sixty, the first division by sixty being the minute. The SI definition of second is ""the duration of 9 192 631 770 periods of the radiation corresponding to the transition between the two hyperfine levels of the ground state of the caesium 133 atom"". Seconds may be measured using a mechanical, electrical or an atomic clock.",what fraction of one minute is 23 second(s)
sindhi is the official language of which state in india,"['https://codepoints.net/U+FB81', 'https://microsofttranslator.uservoice.com/forums/421776-how-do-i-get-my-language-supported?category_id=177039', 'https://communicationdubai.com/english-to-sindhi-translation.php', 'http://www.alooha.net/spa/language_about_Sindhi_snd.html', 'https://www.tomedes.com/language-translation-service.php', 'http://barechahariabhowna.com/trivia/sinhala-novels-pdf-files.php', 'https://support.muslimpro.com/hc/en-us/community/posts/360032100491-Change-the-flag-in-Translation-language']","Sindhi / ˈsɪndi / (سنڌي ‎, सिन्धी,, ਸਿੰਧੀ) is an Indo-Aryan language of the historical Sindh region, spoken by the Sindhi people. It is the official language of the Pakistani province of Sindh. In India, Sindhi is one of the scheduled languages officially recognized by the central government, though Sindhi is not an official language of any of the states in India.",sindhi is the official language of which state in india
