what was the outcome of the battle at the alamo,"['http://weststpaulantiques.com/thealamo.html', 'https://historybytez.com/2016/03/06/1836-texas-revolution-battle-of-the-alamo/', 'http://silverhawkauthor.com/artillery-and-armoured-fighting-vehicles-preserved-in-the-usa-texas-corpus-christi-uss-lexington-and-san-antonio-the-alamo_929.html', 'https://www.ourgenerationusa.com/best-of-the-old-west.html', 'https://www.spectroom.com/category/171026040-battles', 'https://majormike.us/2017/02/23/today-in-history-022317/', 'https://wikivividly.com/wiki/Adolfo_Romero_Lainas']","The Battle of the Alamo (February 23 -- March 6, 1836) was a pivotal event in the Texas Revolution. Following a 13-day siege, Mexican troops under President General Antonio López de Santa Anna launched an assault on the Alamo Mission near San Antonio de Béxar (modern-day San Antonio, Texas, United States), killing all of the Texian defenders. Santa Anna's cruelty during the battle inspired many Texians -- both Texas settlers and adventurers from the United States -- to join the Texian Army. Buoyed by a desire for revenge, the Texians defeated the Mexican Army at the Battle of San Jacinto, on April 21, 1836, ending the revolution.",what was the outcome of the battle at the alamo
nfl team that has never won a super bowl,"['http://research.omicsgroup.org/index.php/List_of_NFL_franchise_post-season_droughts', 'http://www.primidi.com/list_of_nfl_franchise_post-season_droughts', 'https://howlingpixel.com/i-en/1969_NFL_Championship_Game', 'http://www.nepatriotslife.com/2018/04/nate-solder-thanks-new-england-in.html']","Of the 12 teams that have never won the Super Bowl, four (4) are expansion franchises younger than the Super Bowl itself (Bengals, Panthers, Jaguars, and the Texans). The Falcons began playing during the season in which the Super Bowl was first played. The seven (7) other clubs (Cardinals, Lions, Oilers / Titans, Chargers, Browns, Bills, and Vikings) all won an NFL or AFL championship prior to the AFL -- NFL merger; in the case of the Vikings, however, the Super Bowl existed at the time they won their league title, leaving them and the Falcons as the only two teams to have existed for as long as or longer than the Super Bowl and to have never secured the highest championship available to them. The longest drought since a championship of any kind is that of the Cardinals, at 69 seasons.",nfl team that has never won a super bowl
what does the democratic republic of congo flag represent,"['http://www.e-wloski.pl/forum/www-billsauthorizedshops-com-f10t1319.html', 'http://glassfiber.cande.biz/modules/newbb/viewtopic.php?topic_id=69081&forum=4', 'http://stary.snooker.pl/forum/viewtopic.php?f=31&amp;t=80071&amp;p=137314&amp', 'https://www.creditinsurancenews.com/issue83.php', 'https://publicdomainphotography.com/gallery/Democratic-Republic-of-the-Congo-Flag-Free-Stock-Photos/278/page1/', 'https://diversityflags.com/de-lu/942/democratic-republic-congo-flag', 'http://el-mumio.surprice321.com/showthread.php?tid=6581']","The national flag of the Democratic Republic of the Congo is a sky blue flag, adorned with a yellow star in the upper left canton and cut diagonally by a red stripe with a yellow fimbriation. It was adopted on 20 February 2006. A new constitution, ratified in December 2005 and which came into effect in February 2006, promoted a return to a flag similar to that flown between 1963 and 1971, with a change from a royal blue to sky blue background. Blue represents peace. Red stands for ""the blood of the country's martyrs"", yellow the country's wealth; and the star a radiant future for the country. (subscription required)",what does the democratic republic of congo flag represent
who's birthday is celebrated as teachers day,"['http://reference.allrefer.com/did-you-know-the-13-presidents-of-india-since-the-introduction-of-the-post-in-1950-5339', 'https://m.jagranjosh.com/general-knowledge/amp/dr-sarvepalli-radhakrishnan-1535713553-1?ref=amp_prev', 'http://answerangels.com.au/do-you-know-about-teachers-day/', 'http://williballenthin.com/teachers-day-essay-in-kannada-language.html', 'http://www.bhagwanbhajan.com/stories/read-story.php?my-story=who-is-dr-sarvepalli-radhakrishnan--845736', 'http://iasipstnpsc.in/gk-national-teachers-day-september-5/', 'http://iasipstnpsc.in/world-teachers-day-is-obseved-on-5-october/']","Radhakrishnan was awarded several high awards during his life, including a knighthood in 1931, the Bharat Ratna, the highest civilian award in India, in 1954, and honorary membership of the British Royal Order of Merit in 1963. Radhakrishnan believed that ""teachers should be the best minds in the country"". Since 1962, his birthday is being celebrated in India as Teachers' Day on 5 September.",whose birthday do we celebrate as teacher's day in india
where does the glass from glass beach come from,"['http://elclubo.com/northern-territory/how-to-get-to-glass-beach-fort-bragg.php', 'http://mightymo-market.blogspot.com/2013/07/august-weekend-edition.html', 'http://hiddencalifornia.com/blog/index.html', 'https://voyagenation.com/en/amp/Glass-Beach-California/Fort-Bragg/California', 'https://www.amusingplanet.com/2016/10/a-blast-from-past-episode-27.html', 'http://www.sweatlikebecky.com/2017/08/summer-vacation-part-3-all-things.html', 'https://www.coastguide.org/articles/tag/July+2018']","Glass Beach is a beach in MacKerricher State Park near Fort Bragg, California, that is abundant in sea glass created from years of dumping garbage into an area of coastline near the northern part of the town.",where does the glass from glass beach come from
what is the meaning of eid in arabic,"['https://www.thekeriscollector.com/2017/09/01/salam-eidul-adha-2017-muslims/', 'http://industrious.info/trends/21-08-2018/eid-al-adha.html', 'https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmXoypizjW3WknFiJnKLwHCnL72vedxjQkDDP1mXWo6uco/wiki/Eid_al-Adha.html', 'https://bukitlanjan.blogspot.com/2017/08/', 'https://traveltipsinfrance.wordpress.com/2018/10/25/visiting-morocco-some-helpful-tips-to-prepare/', 'https://cpcom.alminaret.com/blog/what-is-eid-al-adha', 'https://likewike.com/harmony-and-brotherhood-in-society-pm-narendra-modis-wishes-on-eid-al-adha/']","Eid al-Adha (Arabic: عيد الأضحى ‎, translit. ʿīd al-aḍḥā, lit.' Feast of the Sacrifice' ‎, (ʕiːd ælˈʔɑdʕħæː)), also called the ""Sacrifice Feast"", is the second of two Muslim holidays celebrated worldwide each year, and considered the holier of the two. It honors the willingness of Ibrahim (Abraham) to sacrifice his son, as an act of obedience to God's command. Before Abraham sacrificed his son, God provided a male goat to sacrifice instead. In commemoration of this, an animal is sacrificed and divided into three parts: one third of the share is given to the poor and needy; another third is given to relatives, friends and neighbors; and the remaining third is retained by the family.",what is the meaning of eid in arabic
what does ground state of an electron mean,"['https://thespectrumofriemannium.wordpress.com/category/chemistry/', 'http://bioenergy.timleitch.net.nz/energies/electron_waves.htm', 'https://alevelphysics.co.uk/notes/energy-levels-photon-emission/', 'https://www.electrical4u.com/wave-particle-duality/', 'https://www.slideserve.com/genera/bremsstrahlung', 'http://pages.vassar.edu/magnes/qm/', 'https://testmyprep.com/subject/philosophy/philosophical-understanding-of-science-science-as']","The energy associated to an electron is that of its orbital. The energy of a configuration is often approximated as the sum of the energy of each electron, neglecting the electron-electron interactions. The configuration that corresponds to the lowest electronic energy is called the ground state. Any other configuration is an excited state.",what does ground state of an electron mean
how many star wars trilogies will there be,"['https://magyarokszovetsege.eu/neuer-star-wars-film-2019.html', 'http://www.spoilerfreemoviesleuth.com/2018/02/news-david-s-goyer-exits-master-of.html', 'http://www.projectcasting.com/casting-calls-acting-auditions/star-wars-9/', 'https://womansera.com/alia-bhatt-and-ranbir-kapoor-to-get-married-in-june-end-this-year/', 'https://www.glamsham.com/en/this-legendary-actor-to-be-seen-in-panipat', 'https://www.bollywoodcouch.com/national-award-winning-make-up-artist-vikram-gaikwad-joins-ashutosh-gowarikers-panipat-team/', 'https://www.glamsham.com/en/ashutosh-gowarikers-panipat-team-gets-a-new-entrant']","Unlike the previous two trilogies, whose films were released approximately three years apart, the sequel films are planned to be released two years apart. Star Wars: The Last Jedi is set for release on December 15, 2017, with Rian Johnson as screenwriter and director. Episode IX was to be directed by Colin Trevorrow; however, in September 2017, Lucasfilm announced that he had departed from the project, and shortly after announced that Abrams would return to direct the film and co-write it with Chris Terrio. The film is scheduled to be released on December 20, 2019.",how many star wars trilogies will there be
what is the function of the sensory system in the nervous system,"['https://www.simply.science/biology/human-physiology/sensory-system/eye', 'https://www.subscribetech.com/wiki/sensory-system/', 'https://www.anxietycentre.com/anxiety-symptoms/hearing-loss-deafness-anxiety.shtml', 'https://www.labroots.com/tag/sensory-systems/webinars', 'https://www.growinghandsonkids.com/interoception-8th-sensory-system.html', 'https://tracybryan.com/making-sense-of-it-all/?replytocom=4417', 'https://www.creativebiomart.net/researcharea-sensory-system-proteins_98.htm']","The sensory nervous system is a part of the nervous system responsible for processing sensory information. A sensory system consists of sensory neurons (including the sensory receptor cells), neural pathways, and parts of the brain involved in sensory perception. Commonly recognized sensory systems are those for vision, hearing, touch, taste, smell, and balance. In short, senses are transducers from the physical world to the realm of the mind where we interpret the information, creating our perception of the world around us.",what is the function of the sensory system in the nervous system
who is regarded as the father of modern computer,"['http://ailab.ijs.si/dunja/TuringSLAIS-2012/', 'https://www.smore.com/wzux', 'https://atgvintagewatches.com/bremont-codebreaker-forum-2013-a/5474-alan-turing.html', 'http://2013.100daysproject.co.nz/project/day/97/2013/45', 'http://www.liquisearch.com/alan_turing', 'http://www.exponentialtimes.net/people/alan-turing', 'http://www.ekadiantari.com/2015/02/the-imitation-game-review.html']","Turing was highly influential in the development of theoretical computer science, providing a formalisation of the concepts of algorithm and computation with the Turing machine, which can be considered a model of a general purpose computer. Turing is widely considered to be the father of theoretical computer science and artificial intelligence.",who is regarded as the father of modern computer
when is brawl stars going to be released in the usa,"['https://apkiostreasure.com/brawl-stars-mod-apk/', 'http://anuptechtips.com/top-rich-apps-google-playstore/', 'http://tofoodreviews.com/victoria/how-to-get-brawl-stars-on-bluestacks.php', 'https://www.viewfromthepark.com/category/apple/iphone/page/3/', 'http://www.canaancolonial.org/page/997/', 'http://www.aueem.com/valve/1418.html', 'http://breath-of-fresh-air.us/tag/hack-for-clash-royale/']","Brawl Stars is a freemium mobile real-time strategy video game developed and published by Supercell. On June 14, 2017, Supercell announced the game via livestream video on Youtube. It received an iOS soft launch in the Canadian App Store the following day, June 15, 2017. It is yet to be released on Android devices or in other countries.",when is brawl stars going to be released in the usa
process of rooftop rainwater harvesting system followed in different parts of india,"['http://www.pumpsncontrols.com/types-of-water-harvesting.html', 'https://ralandscaping.com/what-is-a-rainwater-harvesting/', 'http://akinbacioglu.com/12584.html', 'http://togethervcan.in/article/some-useful-tips-to-conserve-water/', 'http://www.peacefmonline.com/pages/local/news/201403/194765.php', 'https://ethicons.com/?url=blog%2Fprivacy-policy%2F', 'http://haryali.org/our-activities/water-harvesting-save-life/']","Rainwater harvesting is the accumulation and deposition of rainwater for reuse on-site, rather than allowing it to run off. Rainwater can be collected from rivers or roofs, and in many places, the water collected is redirected to a deep pit (well, shaft, or borehole), a reservoir with percolation, or collected from dew or fog with nets or other tools. Its uses include water for gardens, livestock, irrigation, domestic use with proper treatment, indoor heating for houses, etc. The harvested water can also be used as drinking water, longer-term storage, and for other purposes such as groundwater recharge.",process of rooftop rainwater harvesting system followed in different parts of india
where does the withlacoochee river begin and end,"['http://canoegatorstyle.com/River.htm', 'https://www.mapsofworld.com/usa/states/texas/texas-river-map.html', 'https://www.theoutdoorlife.us/biking-kayaking-at-cypress-glen/', 'https://www.worldatlas.com/articles/what-is-the-source-of-the-ob-river.html', 'https://cyndi-lenz.com/category/florida-back-roads/', 'https://www.britannica.com/print/article/25464', 'http://www.eosnap.com/tag/washington/page/2/']","The Withlacoochee River (or Crooked River) originates in central Florida's Green Swamp, east of Polk City. It flows west, then north, and then turns northwest and finally west again before it empties into the Gulf of Mexico near Yankeetown. The river is 141 miles (227 km) long and has a drainage basin of 1,170 square miles (3,000 km). It is believed to have been named after the Withlacoochee River to the north.",where does the withlacoochee river begin and end
when is the new x-files going to start,"['http://www.poputrade.com/wholesale-the-x-files-season-11-3dvd-10pcslot-p-6964.html', 'http://www.poputrade.com/wholesale-the-x-files-season-11-3dvd-50pcslot-p-6965.html', 'http://viktorkalina.info/news.php?action=show&id=43386', 'https://geekcasket.com/x-files-official-trailer-season-11/', 'http://mp4moviez.desi/movie/10076/The_x-files_(season_11)_episodes.html', 'https://m.gifmania.co.uk/TV-Series-Animated-Gifs/Animated-Science-Fiction-Tv-Series/X-Files/?p=16', 'http://deluge-torrent.info/?option=com_content&view=article&id=46449']","The eleventh season of the American science fiction television series The X-Files premiered on January 3, 2018, on Fox. The season, consisting of ten episodes, follows newly re-instated Federal Bureau of Investigation (FBI) agents Fox Mulder (David Duchovny) and Dana Scully (Gillian Anderson). The season's storyline picks up directly after last season's finale and the search for Mulder and Scully's son William is the main story arc for the season.",when is the new x-files going to start
when was the electoral college added to the constitution,"['https://worldhistoryproject.org/1804/6/15/the-twelfth-amendment-is-ratified', 'https://www.thoughtco.com/12th-amendment-4176911', 'https://www.freeunblocked.pw/index.php?q=aHR0cHM6Ly9lbi53aWtpcGVkaWEub3JnL3dpa2kvTGlzdF9vZl9Vbml0ZWRfU3RhdGVzX3ByZXNpZGVudGlhbF9lbGVjdGlvbnNfYnlfcG9wdWxhcl92b3RlX21hcmdpbg==', 'http://webot.org/info/en/?search=Article_Two_of_the_United_States_Constitution', 'https://politicalpistachio.blogspot.com/2019/03/corona-constitution-class-amendments-11.html?m=1', 'http://library.faithandfreedom.us/2015/03/twelfth-amendment-to-us-constitution.html', 'https://definitions.uslegal.com/t/twelfth-amendment/']","The Twelfth Amendment (Amendment XII) to the United States Constitution provides the procedure for electing the President and Vice President. It replaced the procedure provided in Article II, Section 1, Clause 3, by which the Electoral College originally functioned. Problems with the original procedure arose in the elections of 1796 and 1800. The Twelfth Amendment refined the process whereby a President and a Vice President are elected by the Electoral College. The amendment was proposed by the Congress on December 9, 1803, and was ratified by the requisite three-fourths of state legislatures on June 15, 1804.",when was the electoral college added to the constitution
what makes it possible for some medications to be absorbed under the tongue,"['https://www.longecity.org/forum/topic/100205-sublingual-nr-and-nmn/', 'http://immortalhair.forumotion.com/t6438p75-beginning-my-oil-pulling-journey', 'https://thatsnatural.info/questions-answers-tn-cbd-hemp-oil/', 'https://www.primewellnessofct.com/portfolio-items/forms-of-medicine/', 'http://wynardtage.de/cheap-propecia-uk', 'http://nlfindia.com/patients/diet_nutrition.php', 'https://premierpharmrx.com/blogs/news/sublingual-absorption-getting-ten-times-more-out-of-your-supplements-and-faster']","When a chemical comes in contact with the mucous membrane beneath the tongue, it is absorbed. Because the connective tissue beneath the epithelium contains a profusion of capillaries, the substance then diffuses into them and enters the venous circulation. In contrast, substances absorbed in the intestines are subject to first-pass metabolism in the liver before entering the general circulation.",what makes it possible for some medications to be absorbed under the tongue
where is the inca empire located on a map,"['http://www.catdrivers.com/Peru.php', 'https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmXoypizjW3WknFiJnKLwHCnL72vedxjQkDDP1mXWo6uco/wiki/Inca.html', 'https://www.classicalimages.com/collections/prints?page=22', 'http://www.newworldencyclopedia.org/entry/Pachacuti', 'https://www.charel-klein-photography.com/2017/03/26/cuenca-searching-the-perfect-guitar-hiking-above-4-000m-in-the-pn-cajas-and-visiting-the-first-inca-site/', 'https://wikivisually.com/wiki/Indian_auxiliaries', 'http://oesdorf.info/89465-empire-earth-2-crack.html']","From 1438 to 1533, the Incas incorporated a large portion of western South America, centered on the Andean Mountains, using conquest and peaceful assimilation, among other methods. At its largest, the empire joined Peru, large parts of modern Ecuador, western and south central Bolivia, northwest Argentina, north and central Chile and a small part of southwest Colombia into a state comparable to the historical empires of Eurasia. Its official language was Quechua. Many local forms of worship persisted in the empire, most of them concerning local sacred Huacas, but the Inca leadership encouraged the sun worship of Inti -- their sun god -- and imposed its sovereignty above other cults such as that of Pachamama. The Incas considered their king, the Sapa Inca, to be the ""son of the sun.""",where is the inca empire located on a map
