who does kroy biermann play for in the nfl,"['https://spousewiki.com/kroy-biermanns-wiki-net-worth-child-children-parents-salary-family/', 'https://www.playerprofiler.com/article/tevin-coleman-devonta-freeman/', 'https://wikivividly.com/wiki/LaDainian_Tomlinson', 'https://howlingpixel.com/i-en/1996_NFL_Draft', 'https://ipfs.io/ipfs/QmXoypizjW3WknFiJnKLwHCnL72vedxjQkDDP1mXWo6uco/wiki/James-Michael_Johnson.html', 'https://howlingpixel.com/i-en/Aqib_Talib', 'https://wikimili.com/en/Vernon_Fox']","Kroy Evan Biermann (born September 12, 1985) is an American football outside linebacker who is currently a free agent. He was drafted by the Atlanta Falcons in the fifth round of the 2008 NFL Draft. He played college football at Montana. He is married to Don't Be Tardy star Kim Zolciak.",who does kroy biermann play for in the nfl
how does the census play a role in determining each state's number of representatives in the house,"['https://www.cs.mcgill.ca/~rwest/wikispeedia/wpcd/wp/u/United_States_House_of_Representatives.htm', 'http://www.bestwatchesunder1000.net/is-canceled-will-finish-run-after-season-8-3.html', 'http://www.factbites.com/topics/Housing', 'http://www.bestwatchesunder1000.net/texas-home-of-representatives-2.html', 'http://www.bestwatchesunder1000.net/directory-of-representatives-house-gov-5.html', 'http://www.bestwatchesunder1000.net/tag/chairman', 'http://www.bestwatchesunder1000.net/texas-home-of-representatives.html']","Under Article I, Section 2 of the Constitution, seats in the House of Representatives are apportioned among the states by population, as determined by the census conducted every ten years. Each state is entitled to at least one Representative, however small its population.",how does the census play a role in determining each state's number of representatives in the house
